WEBVTT

00:00:01.417 --> 00:00:06.912
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> England really need a goal now, they’re losing 2–1, with only five minutes left.

00:00:07.357 --> 00:00:08.587
But here comes Matthews.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.115
What can he do here?

00:00:10.139 --> 00:00:12.075
He goes past one defender, and another!

00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:14.245
The goalkeeper’s coming towards him.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:15.989
Matthews shoots.

00:00:16.302 --> 00:00:20.992
And the ball goes over the goalkeeper, and into the goal!

00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:23.494
That is a fantastic goal!

00:00:23.621 --> 00:00:29.893
That is the Matthews magic! England 2, Germany 2!